{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And HaShem did.</b> The sense of <b>and all the livestock of Egypt died</b> is the majority of it, for it is written, send your livestock (Exodus 9:19), and likewise you find in the hail, all the vegetation of the field (Exodus 9:25), and the proof is from the plague of the locusts: and it ate the remnant of the survivors (below, verse 10)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:51.855130912Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}